WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:20.000
One nitrogen atom, several destinations

00:20.000 --> 00:44.000
Begin with a finite pulse

00:44.000 --> 01:04.000
Uptake can exceed immediate assimilation

01:04.000 --> 01:24.000
Replace the water at hour six

01:24.000 --> 01:44.000
Growth continues using stored nitrogen

01:44.000 --> 02:12.000
Connect stored nitrogen to later growth

02:12.000 --> 02:34.000
Match concentration, vary nutritional history

02:34.000 --> 03:00.000
Test storage rather than assume it
